Warning [jet.SubjectShorthandNesting]: Subject shorthand `.len(…)` is nested inside another subject shorthand
  --> tests/ui_lint/subject_shorthand_nesting.jet:3:27
    |
  3 |     print(words.map(.map(.len())))
    |                           ^^^
 Why: Implicit subjects become hard to track when shorthand scopes nest
 Fix: Rewrite it with a named binding: `fn(item) { item.len(…) }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0512
